I'd put jumping boots above the BoH (/poly can usually get them for
you); with those you can cross medusa/castle, and vlad has water
walking.  You will want levitation for Astral but you should be able
to find/polypile it by then.

If you're careful with inventory management, the BoH isn't necessary,
but it does allow you to keep more extra resources local and it's very
convenient.

